    "post_text": [
      "Come play an 18 hole aviation themed miniature golf course. We are located next to the Runway Park at GMU. We serve coffee, ice cream, shaved ice.",
      "Have you ever scrolled through your phone and stumbled onto a post that moves you to help?  Well, my 6am scrolling with the sun peaking over the trees did just that!\n\nI came across this post from my friends at Kidding Around Greenville, SC and thought I’d help to share to get the word out.\n\nMy grandmother was a foster parent and had more than 30 kids come through her doors.  Even when I was a kid, she was still helping.  I remember it well and was in awe of her kindness.  \n\nPlus, we are a kid business- wouldn’t it be fun for kids to help other kids?  I’ll be taking mine 😊\n\nSo here’s the details:\n\n✅ Kits for Kids - school supplies for foster kids!\n\n✅ Average cost $10-15\n\n✅ Drop off at locations in the link\n\n✅ Or they have a Target wish list you can purchase from and send directly to the volunteers.\n\nhttps://www.facebook.com/share/p/14sV3y5QmH2/?mibextid=wwXIfr"
